    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distance future, an alien has crashed on Earth - you must help him recover the scattered beings which power his engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, fight monsters, &amp; collect items as you play thru 5 sets of hand-drawn pixel environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can expect to:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect loot\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visit shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >improve your stats with fun pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock more as you progress, including fully animated cutscenes\u00a0explore your character's origins and get a glimpse into the mysterious world of Alienhead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distance future, an alien has crashed on Earth - you must help him recover the scattered beings which power his engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, fight monsters, &amp; collect items as you play thru 5 sets of hand-drawn pixel environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can expect to:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect loot\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visit shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >improve your stats with fun pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock more as you progress, including fully animated cutscenes\u00a0explore your character's origins and get a glimpse into the mysterious world of Alienhead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
